      Entry: 1
      Data: The cubes' normal (fully shown) scale. Fixed here instead of being read
        from the transform at runtime, since that reads whatever scale happened to
        be set at the moment Start() ran and could race against an early StartPlanetMode/StartConstellationMode
        call.
